OL,3,GNEWSANew homes plan for footwear
OL,4,Amachinery site approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 311 flats and 43 houses on
OL,7,Fpart of the former British United Shoe
OL,8,FMachinery (BUSM) site in Leicester have
OL,9,Fbeen given the go-ahead.
OL,11,FLeicester City Council has approved a
OL,12,Fplanning application from Trafalgar
OL,13,FGlobal Ltd to build houses as well as
OL,14,Fseven blocks of flats ranging from four
OL,15,Fto five storeys in height on land on
OL,16,Fpart of the former BUSM site.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
