OL,3,GNEWSANew homes plan for footwear
OL,4,Amachinery site approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,7,F(LDRS) previously said during the 20th
OL,8,FCentury the firm became the world's
OL,9,Flargest manufacturer of footwear
OL,10,Fmachinery and in the 1960s it employed
OL,11,Fmore than 4,500 people.
OL,13,FPlanning documents state the site forms
OL,14,Fpart of a "wider regeneration plan"
OL,15,Ffirst envisaged in the early 2000s.
